00:28:48.950 --> 00:28:51.670
community is more about
composable libraries

00:28:51.670 --> 00:28:54.414
and composable toolkits to
build the eventual software

00:28:54.414 --> 00:28:56.080
that you need, then
rather than building

00:28:56.080 --> 00:28:58.234
one huge monolith of
opinionated framework.

00:28:58.234 --> 00:29:00.150
FRANCESC CAMPOY: So that
